<v Ira   Glass>WBEZ management oversight for our program provided by Torey Malatia, who asked me to tell you that he can kick the ass of anybody in Manhattan, Brooklyn, Queens, the Bronx.
<v Ira   Glass>我们节目的WBEZ管理监督由托里·马拉蒂亚（Torey Malatia）提供，他让我告诉你，他可以踢曼哈顿、布鲁克林、皇后区、布朗克斯任何人的屁股。

00:57:40.010 --> 00:57:46.140
<v Jorge Just>And this is something that people in New York have never ever, ever, ever, ever, ever believed.
<v Jorge Just>这是纽约人从来、从来、从来、从来、从来、从来没相信过的事情。

